{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a92c6e7f25ad1964d9ec3da98e4fa4d9.avif?t=1771619837\" width=780 height=90 /></span>Crypterion is a new approach to visual novels, mixing open-world adventuring with a complex plot where every choice matters and no two playthroughs will ever be the same.\u00a0 Start by defining your character, navigate down a myriad of branching paths, and become the most powerful person in Rimshot. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/0e58e07f11822160407d7da1cc870397.avif?t=1771619837\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/58a1e10b57b067764891cc7d163e265e.poster.avif?t=1771619837\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/58a1e10b57b067764891cc7d163e265e.webm?t=1771619837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/58a1e10b57b067764891cc7d163e265e.mp4?t=1771619837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique blend of visual novels, point-and-click adventures, and open-world exploration, with open-ended gameplay allowing you to decide which way to rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over two hundred choices branching the plot into multiple non-overlapping story arcs, fleshed out by a script totaling over 120,000 words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable main character with selectable preferences, dislikes, and more, which the game will react to - and more changes occur as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 6 unique planets of the Rimshot system, seeking a path to riches and power. Build a business, look for spoils, become a TV celebrity - and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is not an option: When your character stumbles, some paths close, others open - even if these lead to places where you have to work off your debt... Or launch a daring escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/8865b6880d0fa7a315aa32be63ae0926.avif?t=1771619837\" width=780 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/fd36291ed3aa50857bf45bf0e1dda785.avif?t=1771619837\" width=636 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with nearly 40 distinct characters, including eleven unique crewmates. A Saboteur, Genius, Stowaway, Mechanic, Security Officer, Informant, Cook, Doctor, Pilot, Guardian, and Secret Agent.\u00a0Build relations, forge lasting friendships, and even entertain marriage proposals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/f7b5c21144e8be4fa882398a295eb879.avif?t=1771619837\" width=780 height=90 /></span>Players can submit questions on our Discord for a chance to be featured on the in-game TV show, <i>Face To Face\u00ae</i>! Join Sunny Dae, everyone\u2019s favorite TV host, as he asks hard-hitting questions to his guests. Plus, share your fan art with the community\u2014your work might be displayed in-game at locations like the gallery, auction house, treasury, and other points of interest!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/e41f0c54e903075298ab2894b58fdaa6.poster.avif?t=1771619837\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/e41f0c54e903075298ab2894b58fdaa6.webm?t=1771619837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/e41f0c54e903075298ab2894b58fdaa6.mp4?t=1771619837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a7107d097dc9b825328d653bfa6abb9bc1205d90.jpg","localized_name":"A rank celebrity","name":"A rank celebrity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/a7107d097dc9b825328d653bfa6abb9bc1205d90.jpg"},{"icon":"c5a687b7ee10bdf26fbaabd19f7ddbf5dcf91a99.jpg","localized_name":"Capture a bounty","name":"Capture a bounty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/c5a687b7ee10bdf26fbaabd19f7ddbf5dcf91a99.jpg"},{"icon":"ca19a15c80a6c6274bb07682db8947f88ed9e142.jpg","localized_name":"Choose your love","name":"Choose your love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/ca19a15c80a6c6274bb07682db8947f88ed9e142.jpg"},{"icon":"105e76717c689331b2f3d267820c8ae138305489.jpg","localized_name":"Love your choice","name":"Love your choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/105e76717c689331b2f3d267820c8ae138305489.jpg"},{"icon":"1df80a938c0eac7fedb159ec24630e6bd8d6f70c.jpg","localized_name":"Collect 3 Artifacts","name":"Collect 3 Artifacts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1048860/1df80a938c0eac7fedb159ec24630e6bd8d6f70c.jpg"},{"icon":"b866beda24e3772da9d2a992c991c7eecd26ad62.jpg","localized_name":"Collect 6 Artifacts","name":"Collect 6 Artifacts","path"